    17	02-eudr-revision	The enacted December 2025 EUDR revision moved application to 30 December 2026 for most companies and 30 June 2027 for most micro/small operators, and concentrated due-diligence statement submission on the first operator rather than downstream firms.	https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=celex%3A52026DC0191	excerpts/02-eudr-revision.txt — section 1.3 and revised framework summary	checked-by:codex:2026-09-05
    18	02-eudr-representative	Under the consolidated EUDR an operator may mandate an authorised representative to submit the due-diligence statement, while the operator retains responsibility for compliance.	https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1115	excerpts/02-eudr-representative.txt — Article 6(1)	checked-by:codex:2026-09-05
    19	02-ukraine-risk	The European Commission's current EUDR country classification lists Ukraine as low risk.	https://green-forum.ec.europa.eu/countries-and-partnerships/country-classification-list_en	excerpts/02-ukraine-risk.txt — “U” country list	checked-by:codex:2026-09-05
    20	02-low-risk-effect	The Commission says qualifying low-risk sourcing allows simplified due diligence: compliance information remains required, but full risk assessment and mitigation are not.	https://green-forum.ec.europa.eu/countries-and-partnerships_en	excerpts/02-low-risk-effect.txt — “What do the different risk classifications mean”	checked-by:codex:2026-09-05
    21	02-ukraine-system	Ukraine's State Forest Agency says its system traces timber batches from harvest to export, had about 400 active users in April 2026, and provides legality documents and exporter tools.	https://forest.gov.ua/en/news/eu-regulation-eudr-how-ukraine-is-preparing-for-new-export-conditions	excerpts/02-ukraine-system.txt — paragraphs on tracking and digital services	checked-by:codex:2026-09-05
    22	02-credential-boundary	The reviewed official CBAM role descriptions establish importer/declarant, indirect representative, service-provider and accredited-verifier roles but no licensed CBAM-consultant credential.	https://www.douane.nl/onderwerpen/vgem/milieu/cbam/	research inference across official role descriptions; no excerpt	inference
