     5	On 19 December 2025, the European Parliament and the Council adopted a revised EUDR, adding an extra period before the entry into application and introducing some changes on substance. All companies, whether in the EU or elsewhere, received one more year to prepare for entry into application. More specifically, the EUDR will enter into application on 30 December 2026 with regard to all companies except for most micro- or small operators, for which the entry into application is 30 June 2027.
     6	
